    "question": "Detail the constitution, regulatory jurisdiction, and disciplinary powers of the National Financial Reporting Authority (NFRA) under Section 132 of Companies Act, 2013 and NFRA Rules, 2018. Tabulate the classes of companies governed by NFRA, and compare the punitive powers of NFRA with the ICAI Disciplinary Committee.",
